Hi {Owner},

I build websites for independent auto repair shops around {City}. {Business Name} has the kind of reviews most shops would pay for, but no site where a driver can see what you fix or book a slot.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: a check engine and brake-noise symptoms guide, a page explaining how you approve estimates, service booking with drop-off and shuttle details, and a fleet account page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes before you open one morning?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
